1
00:06:40,000 --> 00:06:46,000
Company of Heroes is a action, drama, war film directed by Don Michael Paul.

2
00:13:20,000 --> 00:13:26,000
American soldiers lost behind enemy lines during the WWII make a
horrific discovery: Hitler has a super bomb in development.

3
00:20:00,000 --> 00:20:06,000
Against all odds, they set out to find the scientist in
charge of the program who is looking to defect.

4
00:26:40,000 --> 00:26:46,000
Dean Ranson, played by Tom Sizemore.

5
00:33:20,000 --> 00:33:26,000
Nate, played by Chad Michael Collins.

6
00:40:00,000 --> 00:40:06,000
Brent Willoughby, played by Vinnie Jones.

7
00:46:40,000 --> 00:46:46,000
Luca Gruenewald, played by Jürgen Prochnow.

8
00:53:20,000 --> 00:53:26,000
Ivan Puzharski, played by Dimitri Diatchenko.

9
01:00:00,000 --> 01:00:06,000
Kestrel, played by Melia Kreiling.

10
01:06:40,000 --> 01:06:46,000
Company of Heroes is a 2013 American direct-to-video war
thriller film directed by Don Michael Paul.

11
01:13:20,000 --> 01:13:26,000
The screenplay was co-written by Danny Bilson and Paul De Meo.

12
01:20:00,000 --> 01:20:06,000
It was loosely based on the video game of the same name.

13
01:26:40,000 --> 01:26:46,000
De Meo would later write Company of Heroes 2.

14
01:33:20,000 --> 01:33:26,000
The tone is emotional.
